  partName: Gasket
  description: The Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat component positioned at the middle-center-front
    of the engine, playing a vital role in sealing the engine's internal components.
    Made of Material.003, its small size and strategic location enable it to prevent
    leaks and maintain the engine's internal pressure. Notably, the Gasket's material
    properties ensure a tight seal, even under high temperatures and pressures.
